    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "直率的辭絕",
        "title": "直率的辭絕",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/d576e47ec29592a74d7f18040459665c_6964230212797294985.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>普通攻擊</color>\n造成2點 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "典儀式晶火",
        "title": "典儀式晶火",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/d13eff9275ac9df191b4e1f83bdd18c7_2090368836108021967.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素戰技</color>\n造成3點 <color=#ffe699>岩元素傷害</color> ，本角色附屬 <color=#ffffff>岩元素附魔</color> ；從手牌中 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 至多5張 <color=#ffffff>裂晶彈片</color> ，每 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 1張都使此傷害+1並抽1張牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "裂晶彈片",
        "title": "裂晶彈片",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/db13288db6b90ec33f8adc2656d2019f_8062794155777621997.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>事件牌</color>\n對敵方「出戰角色」造成1點 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> ，抽1張牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": [],
        "talentImg": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/ca5315848113a22db13d032f358ddbdb_4819458860423554051.png"
      },
      {
        "key": "如霰澄天的鳴禮",
        "title": "如霰澄天的鳴禮",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/25547c6b405dc204653b701c121b1096_2223176171615380187.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素爆發</color>\n造成1點 <color=#ffe699>岩元素傷害</color> ，對所有敵方後臺角色造成1點 <color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color> 。召喚 <color=#ffffff>金花禮炮</color> ，生成1張 <color=#ffffff>裂晶彈片</color> 加入手牌。\n<color=#ffffff>金花禮炮</color>\n<color=#ffd780>召喚物</color>\n<color=#ffffff>結束階段：</color> 造成1點 <color=#ffe699>岩元素傷害</color> ，抽1張 <color=#ffffff>裂晶彈片</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數：2</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "互助關係網",
        "title": "互助關係網",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/7e023ac7d7c52126ccbea78e74621bfd_8498300686110865384.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>被動技能</color>\n【被動】 <color=#ffffff>敵方角色受到結晶反應傷害後：</color> 生成3張 <color=#ffffff>裂晶彈片</color> ，隨機置入我方牌庫中。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "岩元素傷害",
        "title": "岩元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/fd37cbfdd3b1b2c16e6e83fb0aa96889_9210157504352936852.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "和已附著的元素發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#ffe699>岩元素</color> + <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>結晶（冰）</color> ：本傷害+1，我方出戰角色獲得1點護盾（可疉加，最多2點）\n【 <color=#ffe699>岩元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>結晶（水）</color> ：本傷害+1，我方出戰角色獲得1點護盾（可疉加，最多2點）\n【 <color=#ffe699>岩元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>結晶（火）</color> ：本傷害+1，我方出戰角色獲得1點護盾（可疉加，最多2點）\n【 <color=#ffe699>岩元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>結晶（雷）</color> ：本傷害+1，我方出戰角色獲得1點護盾（可疉加，最多2點）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/26/125391187/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_47878813354392536.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color>\n物理傷害不會附著元素，也不會發生元素反應。\n<color=#ffffff>捨棄</color>\n透過行動牌或角色技能的效果，將行動牌從手牌或牌庫中棄置。\n<color=#ffffff>岩元素附魔</color>\n<color=#ffd680>狀態</color>\n所附屬角色造成的 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> ，變為 <color=#ffd680>岩元素傷害</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合：2</color>\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合</color>\n每回合結束階段， <color=#ffffff>持續回合</color> -1；\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合</color> 耗盡後，立刻棄置此牌。\n<color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color>\n穿透傷害無法受到傷害加成，但是也無法被護盾、傷害免疫等效果抵消。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數</color>\n此牌效果觸發後，會消耗1次 <color=#ffffff>可用次數</color> ；\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數</color> 耗盡後，立刻棄置此牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ],
